WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.531
Reading varied genres builds vocabulary. Guess meanings from context, verify, and use

00:00:05.531 --> 00:00:07.752
new words in original sentences.

00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:12.606
Which word best describes someone who helps others? Answer: helpful

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.695
Keep a reading vocabulary journal with at least five words and sentences.

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:21.157
Why it works: Helpful means ready to assist.
